Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.05,0:00:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.97,0:01:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba? Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.49,0:01:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be\Nplaying hide-and-seek, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.95,0:01:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Those thugs must have snatched\Nhim back to Pegasus' castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.57,0:01:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So now they've got your grandpa\Nand Kaiba's little brother, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.77,0:01:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.73,0:01:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just another reason for us to win\Nthose ten-star chips and get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.07,0:01:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.57,0:01:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.29,0:01:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's my lucky day. Hands off,\Nthose are mine. Cool, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.77,0:01:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were\Ntraining to become a duelist
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.87,0:01:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,well I figured if a doofus\Nlike Joey can hold his own
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.51,0:01:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,in this game then hey I'll\Nprobably be an expert at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.71,0:01:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognize that monster
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.11,0:01:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't I seen that\Ncard in your deck Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.83,0:01:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this one, but I think I\Ngot something just like it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.65,0:01:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.19,0:01:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Bingo, Swamp Battle Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.31,0:01:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, would you take a look at this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.07,0:02:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,These two look like\Nthey're long-lost brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.21,0:02:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, that doesn't mean your boy\Npacks the same kind of wallop mine does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.23,0:02:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,His wallop is just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.19,0:02:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My lava battle guard\Nhas never let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.91,0:02:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Try him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.82,0:02:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.05,0:02:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It does say they work best together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.85,0:02:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.89,0:02:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I kind of see a resemblance\Nbetween you two and those muscle heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.37,0:02:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Laugh it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.43,0:02:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I take that as a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.11,0:02:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your move, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.11,0:02:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, harpies, give that monster\Nour kind of makeover. Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.83,0:02:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that was a real challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.93,0:02:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It ranks right up there\Nwith doing my nails.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.17,0:02:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was ranked fourth\Nin my district finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, that's great, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.11,0:02:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.31,0:02:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Trashing hotshot duelists is\Nusually as fun as a fall clearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.43,0:02:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I enjoy it anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all because of that\Nobnoxious punk, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.57,0:03:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe such an amateur beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.09,0:03:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to get even with\Nthat grinning gutter punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.81,0:03:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.15,0:03:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Rex Raptor, the dino duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.95,0:03:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm itching to finish that\Nmatch we started on the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.77,0:03:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.09,0:03:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Funny, I thought I already\Nknocked you on your Jurassic butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.03,0:03:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Think whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.01,0:03:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to get stumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.49,0:03:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm gonna waste another\Nminute with a pea brain like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.79,0:03:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat it, dino breath.\NChoo, choo. Pea brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.25,0:03:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I happen to have been a finalist in\Nthis year's regional championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.83,0:03:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll have you know that I've\Nalready won five star chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.81,0:03:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, how'd you get eight chips already?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.37,0:03:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,From wannabes like you who\Nthink that by dueling a chick,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.25,0:03:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll score some easy stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.99,0:03:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I've only lost once, but once I find\Nthat punk kid Joey, it's payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.89,0:03:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you lose to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.59,0:03:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to see you try and... Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.01,0:04:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Rex, I'll duel you, if\Nyou do something for me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.61,0:04:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.52,0:04:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,After all the crazy duelists\Nwe've been running into,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.37,0:04:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,it's nice to see some\Nnormal kids for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.59,0:04:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, how about it, tough guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.45,0:04:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Any of these tykes puny\Nenough for you to take on,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.07,0:04:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,or do you want to go looking\Nfor some three-year-olds?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.39,0:04:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.81,0:04:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You know Joey's just biding his time him
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.45,0:04:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,until he finds a dueling\Nmonkey to challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.15,0:04:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Dueling monkey, nice one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.11,0:04:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Who wants some?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.21,0:04:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more word about dueling\Nmonkeys, and I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.81,0:04:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me that's not who I think it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.95,0:04:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you, Joseph? Glad to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.95,0:04:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ecstatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Joe, is Yugi still fighting\Nall your battles for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.13,0:04:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows if Yugi wasn't there to\Nhold your hand, you wouldn't have beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.67,0:04:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.01,0:04:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true. Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.03,0:04:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I propose he steps out\Nof your shadow here and now
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.59,0:04:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If Joey thinks he's so tough,\Nlet's see him play for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm waiting for your answer\Njoey think you have the guts to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.09,0:05:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,step up and face the duelist i've\Narranged for you it's not you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.23,0:05:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dueling on my behalf. Recognize me.\NThat's Rex Raptor. This twerp supposed to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.85,0:05:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,scare me or something i bet you ain't so\Ntough don't you remember joey rex placed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.57,0:05:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,second in the regionals well joey you\Ngotta ask mommy's permission or what no way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.11,0:05:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,this is my fight joey what are you trying\Nto prove really bro pick your battles
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.49,0:05:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Mai agreed to duel me\Njust for stomping this amateur as Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey had Yugi's help when he beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.89,0:05:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,so having Rex do all my dirty\Nwork is the perfect revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.47,0:05:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and by the way, if little Yugi\Ndoes any of his backseat dueling,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.91,0:05:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,then Joey is disqualified and the\Nmatch automatically goes to Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.93,0:06:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.63,0:06:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your big chance to prove\Nyourself, or are you going to back out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.47,0:06:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course he is. We...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.79,0:06:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's the way I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Just me and him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.33,0:06:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It may cost me all my star chips,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.55,0:06:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't deserve to\Nkeep them if the only
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.69,0:06:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,reason I'm winning is\Nbecause of Yugi's smarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.09,0:06:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,All my life, people are trying to help me\Nbecause they think I can't help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.39,0:06:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't need to be baby this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.19,0:06:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost it, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You can believe whatever you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.03,0:06:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,but I won't just stand here and\Nwatch you throw your chips away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.81,0:06:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you guys don't mind, but little\NJoey won't be coming out to duel today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.77,0:06:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe once he grows up, we\Ncan arrange a play date.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.97,0:06:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.15,0:06:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, what'd you shove me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.37,0:06:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear what\NI just said, wise guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.63,0:06:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of everyone thinking\Nthey gotta come to my rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.95,0:06:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Friends look out for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep out of this, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.23,0:06:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me do what I gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:07:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do what you gotta do, even if it means\Nlosing the chance to help your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.59,0:07:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.59,0:07:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,don't worry sis i'll make you proud
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,listen let's just cool\Noff a second forget it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.15,0:07:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,if mr macho wants to lose\Nhe can do it by himself
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.11,0:07:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,but tristan let him go ah some trouble in
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.93,0:07:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,paradise stay out of this\Nhuh so what's it gonna be
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.63,0:07:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,you're gonna run off\Nwith your friend or start
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,acting like a real duelist\Ni'm still here ain't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.43,0:07:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Yugi. No offense, but\NI want you to keep out of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,this one all right then\Nit's dino feeding time
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.91,0:07:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,we believe in you joey just don't\Nforget what you're fighting for
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.35,0:07:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,what i'm fighting for i got that part down
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.29,0:07:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,it's who i'm fighting\Nthat's making me sweat
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.91,0:08:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Rex, don't forget our deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.03,0:08:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat him and you get to duel with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.29,0:08:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you reduced\Nyourself to being Mize Attack Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.85,0:08:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,At least I'm no dueling monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.39,0:08:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So how many chips do you\Nwant to lose to my Toons?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.21,0:08:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I got two, but I plan on doubling\Nthem right here. You wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.15,0:08:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet your deck isn't even prepared\Nfor the fields we're playing on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.69,0:08:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, if he only knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.41,0:08:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have a hard time\Ntelling one field from another,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.33,0:08:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,let alone using them in\Nany kind of strategic way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.93,0:08:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My best bet's going to be\Nhitting him hard and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.63,0:08:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And I think I know just\Nthe cards to do the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby Dragon and Time Wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.93,0:08:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If I use them together, I can speed up\Ntime and make my dragon super powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.71,0:08:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it worked once\Nbefore when I dueled mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So here's hoping it'll do the job again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit stalling. Let's duel. Bring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.13,0:08:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Taya, keep rooting Joey on for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.79,0:08:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta go see about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.07,0:09:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Pay dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.51,0:09:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have asked for a better hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.31,0:09:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.22,0:09:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd Yugi go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.83,0:09:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.31,0:09:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait till he sees what\NI did all by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.35,0:09:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.93,0:09:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.33,0:09:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.49,0:09:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a baby dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.83,0:09:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Rex knows he's dosed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.41,0:09:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You never leave a baby unattended,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.49,0:09:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're about to find out why.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.67,0:09:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Two-headed King Rex, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.77,0:09:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.05,0:09:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we found out\Nwhat he was made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.09,0:09:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't get to play my combo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.41,0:09:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.57,0:09:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Because even three-year-olds know better\Nthan to defend on their first move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.55,0:09:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, I can't believe you\Nactually did that, you rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.53,0:09:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody makes mistakes, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.95,0:09:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try not to make another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.75,0:10:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.45,0:10:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Joey's already\Nmade the one fatal mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.89,0:10:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,that's going to cost him this entire duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.71,0:10:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and that was ever agreeing to\Nthis match in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.17,0:10:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,With your baby dragon crushed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.57,0:10:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,my two-headed King Rex can terrorize\Nthe field for the rest of the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.61,0:10:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe I did screw up,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but I think I still have one monster\Nin my hand that can beat that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.27,0:10:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Leogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.29,0:10:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Show that over a grown iguana\Nwho the real king of beasts is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.39,0:10:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha, you amateur!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.51,0:10:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we're on a wilderness field, my\NKing Rex gets a nice fat power bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tough luck for your pussycat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.49,0:10:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Field bonus?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.59,0:10:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he tells me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.71,0:10:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rex, foot stomp!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.73,0:10:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.39,0:11:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The quicker I bash this tenderfoot,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.59,0:11:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,the sooner I'll get to have\Nmy chance at beating my...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.73,0:11:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.64,0:11:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the appetizer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.61,0:11:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to get on to the main course!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.71,0:11:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I still got plenty to serve up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, if I finally figured out how to\Nuse this field power bonus thing right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.05,0:11:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing. Axe Raider!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.69,0:11:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, he got the power bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.79,0:11:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.99,0:11:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let it go to your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.35,0:11:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sword arm of dragon, cut\Nthat axe raider down to size.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.65,0:11:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sword tail slash.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.89,0:11:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my third monster he's trashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.15,0:11:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with a field power\Nbonus, I can't beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.71,0:11:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.62,0:11:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let that dino dork intimidate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.21,0:11:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, we're all right\Nbehind you. Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.37,0:11:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why Yugi and Tristan ditched me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.63,0:11:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What a nimrod.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.45,0:12:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Big dumb jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.97,0:12:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.71,0:12:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.65,0:12:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be helping Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.09,0:12:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey made it pretty clear he\Ndidn't want my help on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.89,0:12:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And since you left, I\Nfigured maybe I should too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.01,0:12:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Me being there and you being there\Nare two totally different things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.27,0:12:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Without your coaching,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.43,0:12:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey won't last two minutes against\Nthat conniving little freakasaurus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.53,0:12:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.17,0:12:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta go back there\Nand help him out pronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.67,0:12:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.11,0:12:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey needs to fight this duel\Non his own, and I gotta let him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.19,0:12:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.57,0:12:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If I go back on my promise and\Nhelp Joey, he'll be disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.21,0:12:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, we've gotta believe in\Nhim so he believes in himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.87,0:12:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.78,0:12:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, maybe I\Ndon't think he can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.99,0:12:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But Tristan, this is about something\Nmore important than winning or losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.89,0:12:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is about Joey learning to be a\Nstrong, big brother for his little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.53,0:12:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And even though he doesn't need our help,\Nhe needs to know he has our support.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.31,0:12:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.17,0:13:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe this was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.81,0:13:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the only way to help my\Nsister was by relying on my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.63,0:13:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.25,0:13:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't start thinking that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.91,0:13:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't rely on myself, how\Ncan I expect my little sister to?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.91,0:13:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.01,0:13:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's got to be something\Nin this hand that I can play.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.01,0:13:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.92,0:13:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have this time wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.61,0:13:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad I don't have my baby\Ndragon to play it with anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it couldn't hurt to\Nput it out on the field anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.49,0:13:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.25,0:13:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Time wizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.95,0:13:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.86,0:13:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the card Joey beat me with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.53,0:13:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I should warn Rex. Raptor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.93,0:13:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch that time wizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.61,0:13:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, without Yugi's help, this chump\Ndoesn't even know how to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.31,0:13:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Joey's type.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll try and play a monster next,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.55,0:13:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and then he'll be in for the\Nprehistoric pounding of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.13,0:13:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Rex is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.93,0:13:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey was able to defeat my harpy ladies,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.61,0:13:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,but only because Yugi\Ncoached him through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.27,0:14:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, Joey's all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.37,0:14:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm playing rock ogre in defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.07,0:14:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.19,0:14:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew the rookie didn't know\Nwhat he was doing, Mega-Zalder!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.73,0:14:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wreck that rock old-school style!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.67,0:14:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Horn-ramming charge, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.13,0:14:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Reduced to rubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.39,0:14:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure sent him back to the Stone Ages!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.41,0:14:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.49,0:14:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, flame swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.59,0:14:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn up the heat and carve that\Ndino like it was a big turkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.55,0:14:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you see what I\Ndid to your rock ogre?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.99,0:14:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think that your puny little\Nflame swordsman will last any longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.47,0:14:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'm gonna have to teach\Nyou respect for my Toons the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.35,0:14:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.03,0:14:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Rex, you big dino dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.27,0:14:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Flaming Sword of Battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.99,0:15:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me how a swordsman\Ncan beat a dinosaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually won that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.23,0:15:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no way Joey could have known that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.45,0:15:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,dinosaur cards are especially\Nvulnerable to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.37,0:15:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That jerk, he totally\Nlucked out on that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.47,0:15:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I found the\Nsecret to beating your Toons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.25,0:15:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you're not too sore about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.07,0:15:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it? Sword? Dino? Dinosaur?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.77,0:15:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sword arm of dragon! Want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.17,0:15:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and get it, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.99,0:15:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.90,0:15:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you were gonna\Nmake a comeback, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.15,0:15:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is far from over, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.51,0:15:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,One card won't win this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Alrighty then, I'll just\Nbring out another for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Swamp Battle God!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.11,0:15:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.27,0:15:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a beast that'll wipe that\Nsmirk off your face permanently!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.03,0:15:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.01,0:16:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet the top link of the food chain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.07,0:16:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Serpent Night Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.45,0:16:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This rare card's awarded to\Nthe elite few who have made
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.45,0:16:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,it to the final round of\Nthe regional championships.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.07,0:16:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But for a loser like you, it should be\Nan honor just to get thrashed by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.95,0:16:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nightmare Sonic Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.39,0:16:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He was my best card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.39,0:16:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, poor Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.53,0:16:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, there's not a monster in\Nmy deck that could save me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.13,0:16:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.04,0:16:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan's card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.95,0:16:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, he always shows up somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.05,0:16:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's no concern, you hair job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.71,0:16:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, didn't no one ever teach you not\Nto mess with other people's business?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.83,0:16:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't anyone teach you\Nthat you shouldn't be
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.77,0:16:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,picking on defenseless\Nlittle kids half your size?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.69,0:16:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about we pick on you instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.39,0:16:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, everything all right, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.35,0:16:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.49,0:17:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mess them both up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.89,0:17:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch that guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.65,0:17:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.31,0:17:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.69,0:17:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.85,0:17:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd have been here earlier, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.73,0:17:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.69,0:17:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have taken those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.53,0:17:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you trying to help me\Nout, but I don't need to be babied.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.77,0:17:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,man all this time it finally hits me\Ntristan's always been looking out for
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.15,0:17:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,me not because he thinks i always need\Nhis help but because he's a true friend
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,yo joey huh what we're here\Nfor you buddy so how about it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.51,0:17:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,you're gonna take that car to mine\NWait for a test drive or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.45,0:17:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.47,0:17:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.23,0:17:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Lava Battle God!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.33,0:18:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool, my card's on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.45,0:18:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What a touching reunion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.25,0:18:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad my serpent night dragon\Nis gonna blast it to shreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.99,0:18:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, attack the green one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.95,0:18:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.86,0:18:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My sonic blasts are being deflected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.99,0:18:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How was my dragon's attack repelled?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.45,0:18:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There aren't any trap cards out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.17,0:18:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.43,0:18:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.53,0:18:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The red one blocked for the green one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.83,0:18:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan's card was there\Nright when I needed it most.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.67,0:18:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.58,0:18:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two monsters are like best friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.33,0:18:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,so when they're together on the\Nfield, they help power each other up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.23,0:18:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like how you and Joey help each\Nother out in real life, huh, Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.85,0:18:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what being a buddy is all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.89,0:18:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.43,0:18:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.49,0:18:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What a team!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.87,0:18:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did you take out Rex's monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.83,0:18:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,but you made a nice\Ndebt in his life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.07,0:18:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.37,0:19:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that we're together again, there's\Nnot a monster Rex has that can stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.73,0:19:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Celebrate while you can, because\Nyour party's about to be crashed!
